<mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;defiro&lt;/b&gt; · Logical data model · MVP&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#888888&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL · 15 tables · crow's foot notation · use cases v4.2&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=30;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="900" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes (MVP)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Approve moves to the next position; a correctable rejection returns to position 1, any other rejection ends the procedure&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; step.group_id NULL = the requester's manager (app_user.manager_id)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Group tasks show in the inbox of every group member (group_member); task.decided_by records who decided&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; document.data is JSONB; files live in object storage, file.storage_key = bucket + key&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; audit_log is append-only; it also records role, group membership, account link and deactivation changes&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Identity &amp;amp; authorization&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Authentication is done by the IdP (Keycloak, OIDC). The IdP only says who the person is; roles and group membership live in this database&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; external_identity links an IdP account (issuer + subject, unique) to app_user. Changing or adding an IdP adds a row, never changes app_user.id&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; app_user.id is the only person identifier used in other tables (never sub, oid or email)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; app_user.email is used only to link a pre-registered user on first login, and only if the IdP says email_verified&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; user_role.role &amp;isin; {WORKFLOW_MANAGER, ADMINISTRATOR}; app_user.active = false blocks sign-in" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=16;rounded=1;arcSize=4;absoluteArcSize=1;strokeColor=#cccccc;fillColor=#fafafa;fontSize=13;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1200" width="1000" height="300" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>